{
  "description": "X-HUB: the item view tab bar (Info | Recipes | Uses) on EMI's recipe screen and the Item Info screen: R, U and I on stacks, switching tabs in place, Back leaves the view, views without one stack (all recipes) have no bar, the tab-bar setting off, GUI scales 1-3 and a small window.",
